{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "晉孝武帝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廬山記󱞢裕先生殷周之際受道於仙人\n即岩成舘人稱神仙之廬因名廬山尋陽記山高三千三百六十丈周二百五十里其山九疊水亦九派郡國\n志疊障九層包藏仙跡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見廬山集"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同師安公先居西林"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遠師同母弟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並羅什門\n弟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並遠師門人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云覺明\n罽賓國人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此六覺賢迦維衛國人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "號遺民"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後人名其處曰聰明泉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "王謐有書徃反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "羅什譯智論凡百卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "泥洹即涅槃飜不生不滅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "當是\n禮記小記大記四制等篇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陸德明毛詩音義云周續之與雷次宗同受詩義于遠法\n師亦此類也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "義熈八年先逝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "義熈十年先逝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "義熈六年先逝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "刻梓在越府"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "南唐\n李先主年號即晉高祖皇帝天福四年也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六卷成文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "晉云覺明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語分衛晉言乞食"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內眾外道皆有五明內五\n明者一聲明二醫方明三呪術明四工巧明五因明外五明者前四并同后一是符印明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四十四卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "晉云覺賢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "󴄡蒲曷切草舍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文見廬山集"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "卍字音萬是佛具萬德之相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廬山集載感應事迹甚詳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上采服五采也彩俗下采薇采取也作採俗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今天衣寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廬山集有恭道人臨\n終感應事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲笈七籤本傳\n云元徽五年化"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一字元亮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "應為江右指金陵也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或云□為\n東西二地"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T52n2113_p0596a27"}
{"id": null, "n": "0113001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0113001", "type": "orig", "text": "目錄新作"}
{"id": null, "n": "0121001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0121001", "type": "orig", "text": "此跋依漢魏叢書本載之"}
